{
    "title_en": "Monthly Prices of Marine Fish by Market Level & Species",
    "title_ms": "Harga Ikan Laut Bulanan mengikut Peringkat Pasaran & Spesies",
    "title_sort": 235,
    "description_en": "Monthly average ex-vessel, wholesale and retail prices of fresh marine fish in Malaysia by species, in RM per kg.",
    "description_ms": "Harga purata bulanan ikan laut segar di pantai, borong dan runcit di Malaysia mengikut spesies, dalam RM sekilogram.",
    "exclude_openapi": false,
    "manual_trigger": "2026-10-10 23:02:29.209651",
    "data_as_of": "2025-12",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-10 22:57",
    "next_update": "tbc",
    "methodology_en": "Data on fish prices in Malaysia is collected by the Department of Fisheries (DOF) as part of its fisheries statistics, and published in the Annual Fisheries Statistics (Perangkaan Perikanan Tahunan). Prices are recorded at three levels of the supply chain: at landing (the ex-vessel price paid to fishermen when the catch is landed), at wholesale, and at retail. Each value is the average price for the species in the month, in RM per kilogram of fresh fish, for Malaysia as a whole.",
    "methodology_ms": "Data harga ikan di Malaysia dikumpulkan oleh Jabatan Perikanan sebagai sebahagian daripada perangkaan perikanan, dan diterbitkan dalam Perangkaan Perikanan Tahunan. Harga direkodkan pada tiga peringkat rantaian bekalan: di tempat pendaratan (harga di pantai yang dibayar kepada nelayan semasa hasil tangkapan didaratkan), di peringkat borong, dan di peringkat runcit. Setiap nilai ialah harga purata bagi spesies tersebut dalam bulan berkenaan, dalam RM sekilogram ikan segar, bagi Malaysia secara keseluruhan.",
    "caveat_en": "Months in which no price was recorded for a species are not included. The list of species has changed over time; some species have been split into separate species or into size grades (large, medium, small), which are published as separate categories.",
    "caveat_ms": "Bulan yang tiada harga direkodkan bagi sesuatu spesies tidak dimasukkan. Senarai spesies telah berubah dari semasa ke semasa; sesetengah spesies telah dipecahkan kepada spesies berasingan atau mengikut saiz (besar, sederhana, kecil), yang diterbitkan sebagai kategori berasingan.",
    "publication_en": "\u2014",
    "publication_ms": "\u2014",
    "link_parquet": "https://storage.data.gov.my/agriculture/fish_prices.parquet",
